# Site keeper — the agent that manages the lander

The lander is a `facet app` PRODUCT and this agent is its declared owner (wb-jr1py.14 — the
agents-manage-apps reshape, dogfooded on our own site). Ownership is the `manages` binding the
publish limb authorizes against; posture is `proposed` so every ship of the public site routes
through the human gate (`request self publish lander`) — production front doors don't ship
autonomously.

agent :sitekeeper do
  prompt "You keep workbooks.sh's lander: content freshness, link integrity, and shipping it to the edge when a human approves."
  grant publish
  manages "lander"
  management proposed
end
